{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-image-tools#feature-1","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-image-tools","commit":"e9c741fe7cddd4fad8ef689deee023f54daf9582","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Image Tools 的功能「提示词生成图片」：调用 image-generate，根据提示词和可选尺寸、比例、格式等选项向配置的服务请求图片，并将结果保存为可继续引用的本地资产。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:431-436","lib/index.js:112-139","lib/assets.js:142-168"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-image-tools#feature-2","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-image-tools","commit":"e9c741fe7cddd4fad8ef689deee023f54daf9582","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Image Tools 的功能「参考图编辑」：调用 image-edit，输入当前会话目录中的图片路径或已有 assetId，可附加符合模型能力的蒙版，输出编辑后的图片资产。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:439-448","lib/index.js:93-101","lib/assets.js:89-135"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-image-tools#feature-3","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-image-tools","commit":"e9c741fe7cddd4fad8ef689deee023f54daf9582","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Image Tools 的功能「多服务顺序路由」：未指定服务时按设置顺序尝试可用档案，批次逐张请求并在首张失败时按可转移错误切换服务；返回图片和完成状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:88-194","lib/profiles.js:145-160"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-image-tools#feature-4","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-image-tools","commit":"e9c741fe7cddd4fad8ef689deee023f54daf9582","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Image Tools 的功能「参数化输出」：生成或编辑时可提供尺寸、宽高比、分辨率、质量、格式、压缩和背景参数；插件会依据所选协议及模型能力校验后再发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:402-410","lib/profiles.js:205-266"]}
